# Yathan Tombguard ({2}{B}, 2/3 menace): "Whenever a creature you control with a counter on it deals combat damage to a player,
# you draw a card and you lose 1 life." Bot1's Kin-Tree Nurturer endures 1 with a counter (3/2 lifelink); the Tombguard has none.
# Both connect on turn 3: only the Nurturer triggers, so Bot1 draws one card and loses 1 life (20 - 1 + 3 lifelink = 22), and
# Bot2 takes 3 + 2 = 5. Bot2's lone Ornithopter cannot block the Tombguard (menace, CR 702.110b).

